Popout:{label:"Profil A\xE7\u0131l\u0131r Kart\u0131",description:"Profil a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r kartlar\u0131nda \xF6zel ad format\u0131n\u0131zda listelenen ilk kullan\u0131labilir ad\u0131 g\xF6ster."},voiceChannels:{label:"Ses Kanallar\u0131",description:"Ses kanallar\u0131nda \xF6zel ad format\u0131n\u0131zda listelenen ilk kullan\u0131labilir ad\u0131 g\xF6ster."},reactions:{label:"Tepkiler",description:"Tepki ara\xE7 ipu\xE7lar\u0131nda \xF6zel ad format\u0131n\u0131zda listelenen ilk kullan\u0131labilir ad\u0131, tepki a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r pencerelerinde ise tam ad\u0131 g\xF6ster."},discriminators:{label:"Ayr\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 G\xF6ster",description:"Bot kullan\u0131c\u0131 adlar\u0131na ayr\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 ekleyin. Ayr\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131c\u0131lar normal kullan\u0131c\u0131lar i\xE7in kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131, ancak botlar i\xE7in h\xE2l\xE2 kullan\u0131l\u0131yor. Varsay\u0131lan olarak bir botun kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131 bir kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n global ad\u0131na e\u015Fde\u011Ferdir ve bu nedenle birden fazla bot ayn\u0131 kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131na sahip olabilir. Ayr\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 eklemek onlar\u0131 tekrar benzersiz hale getirir."},hideDefaultAtSign:{label:"Varsay\u0131lan @ \u0130\u015Faretini Gizle",description:"Bahsetmelerde ve yan\u0131tlarda ad\u0131n ba\u015F\u0131ndaki varsay\u0131lan '@' simgesini gizleyin. Yaln\u0131zca ilgili \xF6zellik etkinse uygulan\u0131r."},truncateAllNamesWithStreamerMode:{label:"Yay\u0131nc\u0131 Modunda T\xFCm \u0130simleri K\u0131salt",description:"Yay\u0131nc\u0131 Modundayken yaln\u0131zca kullan\u0131c\u0131 adlar\u0131n\u0131 de\u011Fil, t\xFCm adlar\u0131 k\u0131salt."},removeDuplicates:{label:"Kopyalar\u0131 Kald\u0131r",description:"Adlardan herhangi ikisi ayn\u0131ysa tekrar edenleri kald\u0131rarak yaln\u0131zca benzersiz olanlar\u0131 b\u0131rak."},ignoreFonts:{label:"Yaz\u0131 Tiplerini Yoksay",description:"\u0130kinci, \xFC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC ve d\xF6rd\xFCnc\xFC adlar i\xE7in kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n \xF6zel yaz\u0131 tipini yok sayarak GG SANS kullan."},ignoreGradients:{label:"Gradyanlar\u0131 Yoksay",description:"Birincil olmayan adlar i\xE7in, rol\xFCn bir degradesi varsa ve a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki renk 'Role+-#' olarak ayarlanm\u0131\u015Fsa degradenin tamam\u0131 yerine ana rengi kullan\u0131n ve nitro efekti varsa onu tamamen yok say\u0131n."},animateGradients:{label:"Gradyanlar\u0131 Animasyonlu Yap",description:"\u0130kinci, \xFC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC ve d\xF6rd\xFCnc\xFC adlarda rol gradyan\u0131 varsa animasyonlu g\xF6ster. 'Gradyanlar\u0131 Yoksay' etkinse veya azalt\u0131lm\u0131\u015F hareket a\xE7\u0131ksa devre d\u0131\u015F\u0131 kal\u0131r."},nameSeparator:{label:"Ad Ay\u0131r\u0131c\u0131",description:"Adlar aras\u0131nda kullan\u0131lacak ay\u0131r\u0131c\u0131. Varsay\u0131lan tek bo\u015Fluktur."},friendNameOnlyInDirectMessages:{label:"Arkada\u015F Ad\u0131 Sadece \xD6zel Mesajlarda G\xF6ster",description:"Sadece \xF6zel mesajlarda arkada\u015F adlar\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6ster, sunucularda de\u011Fil."},customNameOnlyInDirectMessages:{label:"\xD6zel Ad Sadece \xD6zel Mesajlarda G\xF6ster",description:"Sadece \xF6zel mesajlarda \xF6zel adlar\u0131 g\xF6ster, sunucularda de\u011Fil."},alwaysShowEffects:{label:"Efektleri Her Zaman Canland\u0131r",description:"\u0130mle\xE7le \xFCzerine gelinmi\u015F gibi efektleri her zaman g\xF6sterir."},includedNames:{label:"Dahil Edilen Adlar",description:"Kullan\u0131c\u0131 adlar\u0131n\u0131n, g\xF6r\xFCnen adlar\u0131n, takma adlar\u0131n ve arkada\u015F adlar\u0131n\u0131n g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFClenme s\u0131ras\u0131. \u015Eu yer tutucular\u0131 kullan\u0131n: {user}, {display}, {nick}, {friend}. Bir ad mevcut de\u011Filse kullan\u0131lacak alternatifleri virg\xFClle ay\u0131rarak yazabilirsiniz: {friend, nick, display}. Her bir ad i\xE7in \xFC\xE7 \xF6n ek ve \xFC\xE7 son ek ekleyebilirsiniz."},customNameColor:{label:"\xD6zel Ad Rengi",description:"\u0130lk g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFClenen de\u011Filse, kullan\u0131c\u0131ya atad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z \xF6zel ad i\xE7in kullan\u0131lacak renk. Ge\xE7erli herhangi bir CSS giri\u015Fini kabul eder. Kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n \xFCst rol renklerini, nitro efekt renklerini veya IRCColors rengini (etkinle\u015Ftirilmi\u015Fse) takip etmek i\xE7in 'Rol'\xFC kullan\u0131n. Parlakl\u0131\u011F\u0131 bu y\xFCzdeye g\xF6re ayarlamak i\xE7in 'Role+-#' kullan\u0131n (\xF6r. 'Rol+15')"},friendNameColor:{label:"Arkada\u015F Ad\u0131 Rengi",description:"Arkada\u015F ad\u0131n\u0131n ilk g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFClenen ad olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131 durumlarda kullan\u0131lacak renk. Ge\xE7erli herhangi bir CSS giri\u015Fini kabul eder. Kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n \xFCst rol renklerini, nitro efekt renklerini veya IRCColors rengini (etkinle\u015Ftirilmi\u015Fse) takip etmek i\xE7in 'Role' kullan\u0131n. Parlakl\u0131\u011F\u0131 bu y\xFCzdeye g\xF6re ayarlamak i\xE7in 'Role+-#' kullan\u0131n (\xF6r: 'Role+15')"},nicknameColor:{label:"Takma Ad Rengi",description:"Takma ad\u0131n ilk g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFClenen ad olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131 durumlarda kullan\u0131lacak renk. Ge\xE7erli herhangi bir CSS giri\u015Fini kabul eder. Kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n \xFCst rol renklerini, nitro efekt renklerini veya IRCColors rengini (etkinle\u015Ftirilmi\u015Fse) takip etmek i\xE7in 'Role' kullan\u0131n. Parlakl\u0131\u011F\u0131 bu y\xFCzdeye g\xF6re ayarlamak i\xE7in 'Role+-#' kullan\u0131n (\xF6r: 'Role+15')"},displayNameColor:{label:"G\xF6r\xFCnen Ad Rengi",description:"G\xF6r\xFCnen ad\u0131n ilk g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFClenen ad olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131 durumlarda kullan\u0131lacak renk. Ge\xE7erli herhangi bir CSS giri\u015Fini kabul eder. Kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n \xFCst rol renklerini, nitro efekt renklerini veya IRCColors rengini (etkinle\u015Ftirilmi\u015Fse) takip etmek i\xE7in 'Role' kullan\u0131n. Parlakl\u0131\u011F\u0131 bu y\xFCzdeye g\xF6re ayarlamak i\xE7in 'Role+-#' kullan\u0131n (\xF6r: 'Role+15')"},